[[2047,127,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Follow the safety instructions\n(See 5040A - Precautions)</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[2047,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the vehicle on a lift.</p><p>Drain the coolant \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238952\">7055A43</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           (right and\nleft)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238959\">7055B10</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts.</p><p>2. Disconnect the pipe connectors.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Seal the disconnected connectors,\nusing suitable plugs, to prevent humidity and impurities from entering\nthe system.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>3. Remove the pipe</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018460.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the pipe is not damaged or cracked.</p><p>Reposition the pipe.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Replace the O-rings for the connectors.</p><p>Only\nuse green coloured seals, resistant to R134A coolant fluid.</p><p>Lubricate\nthe thread of the connectors using anti-freeze.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Connect the pipe connectors.</p><p>Tighten the bolt securing the pipe connector\nto the condenser.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>Condenser pipe connector</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.9 - 1.1</p></td></tr></table></div>"],[86,127,16,"<p>Tighten the bolt fixing the pipe connector\nto the compressor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>Compressor pipe connector</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>3.2 - 4.6</p></td></tr></table></div>"],[512,127,16,"<p>Tighten the bolt fixing the pipe connector\nto the compressor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>Compressor pipe connector</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.9 - 1.2</p></td></tr></table></div>"],[2047,127,16,"<p><a href=\"#/3238959\">7055B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           (right and\nleft).</p><p><a href=\"#/3238952\">7055A43</a></p><p>Repressurize the coolant \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a></p><p>Remove the vehicle from the lift.</p>"],[2047,127,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Follow the safety instructions\n(See 5040A - Precautions)</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[2047,96,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the vehicle on a lift.</p><p>Drain the coolant \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238952\">7055A43</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           (right and\nleft)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238959\">7055B10</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts.</p><p>2. Disconnect the pipe connectors.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Seal the disconnected connectors,\nusing suitable plugs, to prevent humidity and impurities from entering\nthe system.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>3. Remove the pipe</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018461.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,96,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the pipe is not damaged or cracked.</p><p>Reposition the pipe.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Replace the O-rings for the connectors.</p><p>Only\nuse green coloured seals, resistant to R134A coolant fluid.</p><p>Lubricate\nthe thread of the connectors using anti-freeze.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Connect the pipe connectors.</p><p>Tighten the bolt securing the pipe connector\nto the condenser.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>Condenser pipe connector</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.9</p></td></tr></table></div>"],[382,96,16,"<p>Tighten the bolt fixing the pipe connector\nto the compressor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>Compressor pipe connector</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>3.2 - 4.6</p></td></tr></table></div>"],[512,96,16,"<p>Tighten the bolt fixing the pipe connector\nto the compressor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>Compressor pipe connector</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.3</p></td></tr></table></div>"],[2047,96,16,"<p><a href=\"#/3238959\">7055B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           (right and\nleft).</p><p><a href=\"#/3238952\">7055A43</a></p><p>Repressurize the coolant \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a></p><p>Remove the vehicle from the lift.</p>"],[1024,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Observe the following precaution.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Follow the recommended safety\ninstructions (see subgroup 5040 - AIR CONDITIONER CASING AND COMPONENTS)</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Place the vehicle on a lift.</p><p>Drain the coolant (\n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a>\n                                           ).</p><p><a href=\"#/3238964\">7055B42</a>\n                                           (left and right)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           (left\nand right)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238457\">5540B71</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3239044\">7210E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238325\">5040B14</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the connector (1a) for the pipe from the compressor\n(1b).</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Seal the disconnected connectors,\nusing suitable plugs, to prevent humidity and impurities from entering\nthe system.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2070042.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,16,"<p>1. Disconnect the connector (1a) for the pipe from the condenser\n(1b).</p><p>2. Keep the pipe from the condenser to the compressor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2070043.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the pipe is not damaged or cracked.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Replace the O-rings for the connectors.\nOnly use green coloured seals, resistant to R134A refrigerant. Lubricate\nthe thread of the connectors using anti-freeze.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Position the pipe.</p><p>Connect the connector for the condenser\npipe and tighten the bolt.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>COOLANT SYSTEM FITTINGS</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.9</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the compressor pipe connector and\ntighten the bolt.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>COOLANT SYSTEM FITTINGS</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.3</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3238325\">5040B14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3239044\">7210E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238457\">5540B71</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           (left\nand right)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238964\">7055B42</a>\n                                           (left and right)</p><p>Repressurize using coolant fluid (\n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a>\n                                           ).</p>"]]